<Project>

  <!--
    Shared MSBuild targets for every XIL2CPP project.

    Per /Documents/XIL2CPP.html Rev 4 Section 15: this file hosts the
    git-tag-derived Version property used by XIL2CPP.Entry's `version`
    mode (Section 1.1) to compose the printed version line. The git-tag
    derivation logic lands alongside the real version mode in a later
    sub-phase; this Phase 6.a scaffold leaves the property surface empty
    so the plumbing exists and can be extended without restructuring the
    tree.

    Mirrors the XHT precedent at
    /Engine/Source/Programs/XHT/Directory.Build.targets.
  -->

</Project>
